{"t":"Blood Vestibule","s":"blood-vestibule-090b6","k":"local","q":2,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Blood Vestibule</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"ruler\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Ruled by</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Unknown</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"population\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Population</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"organization\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Organizations</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">None</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"near\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Nearby places</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Northern Darama</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Local</caption>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\">Hunting Places</th>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\">Quests</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\"><div class=\"geo-toc\"><ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Darklight%20Core\">Darklight Core</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Gloom%20Pillars\">Gloom Pillars</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Jaded%20Roots\">Jaded Roots</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Putrefactory\">Putrefactory</a></li></ul></div></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\"><div class=\"geo-toc\"><ul><li><a href=\"#/quest/rotten-blood-quest\">Rotten Blood Quest</a></li></ul></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">13.20.13560<br/>July 10, 2023<br/>Summer Update 2023</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Locations <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\n<b>Blood Vestibule</b> is the entrance to the four hunting areas of the <a href=\"#/quest/rotten-blood-quest\">Rotten Blood Quest</a>: <a href=\"#/wiki/Jaded%20Roots\">Jaded Roots</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Putrefactory\">Putrefactory</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Darklight%20Core\">Darklight Core</a>, and <a href=\"#/wiki/Gloom%20Pillars\">Gloom Pillars</a>. According to <a href=\"#/wiki/A%20Bloodshade\">A Bloodshade</a>, it is part of the \"holy Realm of Blood\", belonging to the Sanguine Lord, the Blood God. \n</p><p>A Bloodshade informs players that <a href=\"#/wiki/Bakragore\">Bakragore</a>, a spawn of the Sanguine Lord, has grown in power in the area, giving birth to two sets of twins: <a href=\"#/wiki/Murcion\">Murcion</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Ichgahal\">Ichgahal</a>, and <a href=\"#/wiki/Vemiath\">Vemiath</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Chagorz\">Chagorz</a>. They are corrupting the realm, which is a mockery of its blood god's grandeur, and must be exterminated to cleanse the realm and let it heal.\n</p></div>","quests":["decaying-defender-outfits-quest","rotten-blood-quest"]}